         tar,
         xz-utils
Description: package manager for Pixiewood pixie libraries
 pixie installs the prebuilt Android GTK libraries published by
 pixiewood-pkgs. A system install keeps them in /usr/lib/pixie.
 A user install keeps them in ~/.local/lib/pixie.
 .
 The command is pixie. install, pull, and apply are the operations
 a build uses.
